        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Harrison Newey, Mick Schumacher, Michael Schumacher, Corinna Schumacher, Ralf Schumacher, Sebastian Stahl\n- Organizations: Van Amersfoort Racing\n- Events: 2015 ADAC Formula 4 debut\n- Topics: family relationships in motorsport\n\nFacts:\n- In 2015, Harrison Newey made his ADAC Formula 4 debut with Van Amersfoort Racing.\n- In 2015, Harrison Newey partnered with Mick Schumacher at Van Amersfoort Racing in ADAC Formula 4.\n- Mick Schumacher is the son of Corinna Schumacher and seven-time Formula One World Champion Michael Schumacher.\n- Mick Schumacher is the nephew of former Formula One driver Ralf Schumacher.\n- Mick Schumacher is the stepnephew of Sebastian Stahl.\n- Michael Schumacher is a world champion driver.\n- Ralf Schumacher is a former Formula One driver.",
